error: rsjs boundary: `rsjs::server_only(...)` cannot capture rsjs handler `on_change`

       Why:
         rsjs handlers are client IR callbacks. Opaque server-only boundaries render server HTML, so rsjs cannot inline or replay that callback inside the boundary during hydration.

       Use one of:
         - Render the interactive child directly inside the parent island so the handler can be inlined.
         - Keep the callback on a DOM event handler in the parent island.
         - If the child must remain server-only, pass ordinary server data instead of an rsjs handler.

       Tracked feature:
         component.server_only_handler_capture
  --> tests/ui/conformance/fail/18_server_only_handler_capture.rs:33:54
   |
33 |                 {rsjs::server_only(ServerOnlyChild { on_change })}
   |                                                      ^^^^^^^^^
